      "zh": "并且她们又习惯懒惰，挨家闲游；不但是懒惰，又说长道短，好管闲事，说些不当说的话。",
      "en": "And besides that, going around[NOTE:1] from house to house they learn to be lazy,[NOTE:2] and they are not only lazy, but also gossips and busybodies, talking about things they should not.[NOTE:3]",
